window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c461-c9f25a6ac834379a.json"]={sha256:"c9f25a6ac834379a1e1216decfd016910443019cf7245616f614341092126e0b",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-1e3bbe2df353208c","url":"https://www.schulergroup.com/major/us/technologien/produkte/grundlagen_blechumformung_tiefziehen_presse/index.html","title":"Deep Drawing with Presses","titleEn":"Deep Drawing with Presses","publisher":"Schuler","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c461","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c461","related":[{"id":"c462","referenceUrls":["https://www.ernst-grob.com/processes/spinning"],"title":"金屬旋壓成形","titleEn":"Metal spinning","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：兩種面積算法一致，未將幾何引伸比當成材料成形極限。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Independent area calculations agree and the geometric drawing ratio is not called a forming limit.","difference":"正確定義錐半角與厚度法向，不將剪旋壓正弦律套用全部旋壓。","differenceEn":"Define cone half-angle and normal thickness, without applying the shear-spinning sine law to every spinning process.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["薄板厚度不變且忽略圓角時，πD²/4=πd²/4+πdh，因此 D=√(d²+4dh)。 教學杯直徑 d=60 mm，高 h=40 mm，板厚 1 mm；只作幾何估算。 D=√(60²+4×60×40)=114.891 mm；D/d=1.915，並不因此保證可單次引伸。","理想剪旋壓薄錐 t=t0 sinα，其中 α 是錐壁與旋轉軸夾角；需特定材料流動假設。 合成初厚 2.0 mm，錐半角 30°，忽略回彈與局部不均。 t=2sin30°=1.0 mm；以與底面夾角 60°代入會誤得 1.732 mm。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["With constant thickness and negligible corners, πD²/4=πd²/4+π dh, so D=√(d²+4 dh). Teaching cup diameter d=60 mm, height h=40 mm, thickness 1 mm; geometry only. D=√(60²+4×60×40)=114.891 mm; D/d=1.915 does not prove one-draw feasibility.","For ideal shear spinning t=t 0 sin α, with α between wall and rotation axis; it requires a specific flow idealization. Synthetic initial thickness 2.0 mm, half-angle 30°; neglect springback and local nonuniformity. t=2 sin 30°=1.0 mm; substituting the complementary 60° angle incorrectly gives 1.732 mm.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c471","referenceUrls":["https://www.schenck-rotec.com/en-us/product/"],"title":"高速轉子動平衡","titleEn":"High-speed rotor dynamic balancing","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：兩種面積算法一致，未將幾何引伸比當成材料成形極限。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Independent area calculations agree and the geometric drawing ratio is not called a forming limit.","difference":"區分不平衡量g·mm與振動幅度，說明校正質量位置和相位的重要性。","differenceEn":"Distinguish unbalance in g·mm from vibration amplitude and explain correction radius and phase.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["薄板厚度不變且忽略圓角時，πD²/4=πd²/4+πdh，因此 D=√(d²+4dh)。 教學杯直徑 d=60 mm，高 h=40 mm，板厚 1 mm；只作幾何估算。 D=√(60²+4×60×40)=114.891 mm；D/d=1.915，並不因此保證可單次引伸。","不平衡量U=mr，離心力幅F=Uω²；U需先換成kg·m。單平面模型不處理力偶不平衡。 教學不平衡量10 g·mm，轉速3000 rpm，虛擬校正半徑50 mm。 U=10^−5 kg·m，ω=100π rad/s，F=0.98696 N；理想反相校正質量10/50=0.20 g。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["With constant thickness and negligible corners, πD²/4=πd²/4+π dh, so D=√(d²+4 dh). Teaching cup diameter d=60 mm, height h=40 mm, thickness 1 mm; geometry only. D=√(60²+4×60×40)=114.891 mm; D/d=1.915 does not prove one-draw feasibility.","Unbalance U=mr gives centrifugal-force amplitude F=U ω²; convert U to kg·m. A single-plane model excludes couple unbalance. Teaching unbalance 10 g·mm, speed 3000 rpm, virtual correction radius 50 mm. U=10^−5 kg·m, ω=100 π rad/s, F=0.98696 N; ideal opposite-phase correction mass=10/50=0.20 g.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-dac9fd852dc1d485","url":"https://www.ernst-grob.com/processes/spinning","title":"Ernst Grob Metal Spinning","titleEn":"Ernst Grob Metal Spinning","publisher":"Ernst Grob","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-41d1a8f750a356bc","url":"https://www.schenck-rotec.com/en-us/product/","title":"Schenck Balancing Technology","titleEn":"Schenck Balancing Technology","publisher":"Schenck RoTec","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
